= Julie Sussman
{c}
{parent=Computer science author}

Textbook collaborator credited with <Harold Abelson> and <Gerald Jay Sussman> on <Structure and Interpretation of Computer Programs by Harold Abelson and others>. The publisher credits her as “With”; the CSAIL author profile also identifies her as a coauthor.https://mitpress.mit.edu/9780262510875/structure-and-interpretation-of-computer-programs/[Book byline, With Julie Sussman]{ref}https://www.csail.mit.edu/person/gerald-sussman[Biography, coauthored Structure and Interpretation of Computer Programs with Harold Abelson and Julie Sussman]{ref}

Official publisher profile: https://mitpress.mit.edu/author/julie-sussman-2581

